  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After lifespan Gu steps in the San Cha Mountain blessed land hall, Fang Yuan holds a Gu like a peanut shell, golden, with scarlet blood-trace markings on the surface. At that step the real second aperture Gu has already formed and is nurturing in the peanut shell. Only a strong external force from rank six divine travel Gu can eliminate the false Gu and make it real.",
      "chapters": [
        391
