      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Gu refinement reaches the crucial period, the golden peanut shell collides with divine travel Gu. With the land spirit secretly pouring immortal essence, Fang Yuan activates divine travel Gu; it turns into light speckles and enters the golden peanut shell, and the qualitative change begins.",
